The ''New Voyager'' is a planned series of next-generation interstellar spacecraft under construction by NASA. Unlike all previous warp capable spacecraft, the New Voyager will use [[Gravitonics|artificial-gravity]] to generate its warp field and will be powered primarily by energy quantum teleported from the Sol Dyson swarm, allowing it to achieve the largest warp-field size yet, an unprecedented 400 meters with a top cruising effective speed of approximately 700 times the speed of light.

The ''New Voyager''is by far the most ambitious warp-capable space program in history, with NASA having announced plans to build 100 hulls to help enable the colonization of Alpha Centauri and ease travel between Earth and the exosolar [[Associated state]]s.

